      "hash64": "EBC2337C4A19BD16",
      "text": "呼……我們倆霸占了\\n這麼多可愛的寶可夢，會遭報應的。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
